flowchart TB
    accTitle: The trust boundaries of Paperless Sync
    accDescr: Eight numbered arrows cross a trust boundary. 1: the browser of an administrator sends requests to Paperless Sync in Nextcloud. 2: the app calls Paperless-ngx. 3: the app writes the files below the base folder of the target user. 4: whoever may write to the inbox folder puts files there. 5: a workflow of Paperless-ngx, or anyone on the network, calls the webhook of the app. 6: a member of the group that may send files sends files of their own from Files. 7: a rule of Flow, which only an administrator saves, sends the files that it matches, of any user. 8: a monitor, or anyone on the network, calls the health check of the app. The app keeps the API token and the hashes of the secret of the webhook and of the token of the health check in the credentials manager. The browser, the writers of the inbox, Paperless-ngx, the callers of the webhook, the senders in Files, the users whose files a rule of Flow matches and the callers of the health check are untrusted and have a dashed red border.

    credentials[("Credentials<br>manager:<br>API token,<br>hashes of the<br>webhook secret and<br>the health token")]
    browser(["Browser of an<br>administrator"])
    callers(["A workflow of<br>Paperless, or anyone<br>on the network"])
    app["Paperless Sync<br>in Nextcloud"]
    writers(["Whoever may<br>write to the<br>inbox folder"])
    senders(["A member of the<br>group that may<br>send files, in Files"])
    flow(["Whoever writes a file<br>that a rule of Flow<br>matches"])
    monitor(["A monitor, or<br>anyone on the network"])
    paperless[("Paperless-ngx")]
    files[("Files below<br>the base folder<br>of the target user")]

    credentials --- app
    browser -- "1" --> app
    callers -- "5" --> app
    senders -- "6" --> app
    flow -- "7" --> app
    monitor -- "8" --> app
    app -- "2" --> paperless
    app -- "3" --> files
    writers -- "4" --> files

    classDef untrusted fill:#c9302c1f,stroke:#c9302c,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    class browser,callers,writers,senders,flow,monitor,paperless untrusted
